      "refersTo": "package-reading",
      "description": "Open package with independent unchecked selection.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-row\"><input class=\"ds-control ds-check\" type=\"checkbox\" aria-label=\"Select example update\"/><button class=\"ds-control ds-open\">Example security update<small>Example package · KB sample</small></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-control{font:500 13px 'Segoe UI Variable','Segoe UI',sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background .14s ease-out,color .14s ease-out,border-color .14s ease-out}.ds-control:active{filter:brightness(.93)}.ds-control:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#7fc9ff);outline-offset:4px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-control{transition:none}}.ds-row{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;min-height:84px;padding:0 12px;background:var(--selected,#213a50);border-radius:6px;color:var(--text,#edf4fb)}.ds-row:before{content:'';position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:3px;border-radius:5px 0 0 5px;background:var(--accent,#7fc9ff)}.ds-check{width:18px;height:18px;margin:0 17px 0 1px;accent-color:var(--accent,#7fc9ff)}.ds-open{flex:1;background:none;border:0;padding:18px 0;text-align:left;color:inherit;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4}.ds-open small{display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted,#a6b9cc);margin-top:4px}.ds-open:hover{color:var(--accent,#7fc9ff)}"
