  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Approved graphite Windows utility",
    "overview": "The approved graphite Windows utility is the visual authority (docs/frontend-concept.png). This document finalizes its first implementation; it introduces no replacement visual direction. Compact controls, a blue accent, tonal surfaces, and a generous reading pane support deliberate update decisions.\n\nThe interface uses restrained Windows typography and monoline Lucide icons with an authored four-pane mark. Its subtle title gradient suggests the approved glass character; the implementation uses opaque CSS tonal layers and retains native Windows decorations.",
